  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "We apply each option to the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nOption 1) + and ×\n\n⇒ 20 × 20 + 20 − __**20 ÷ 20**__ = 20\n\n⇒ __**20 **____**×**____** 20**__ + 20 − 1 = 20\n\n⇒ __**400 + 20**__ − 1 = 20\n\n⇒ __**420 − 1**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 419 ≠ 20\n\nOption 2) + and −\n⇒ 20 - 20 × 20 + __**20 ÷ 20**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 20 - **__20 × 20__** + 1 = 20\n\n⇒ __**20**__ - 400 __**+ 1**__ = 20\n\n⇒ __**21 - 400**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 379 ≠ 20\n\nOption 3) × and ÷\n⇒ 20 + __**20 ÷ 20**__ − 20 × 20 = 20\n\n⇒ 20 + 1 − __**20 **____**×**____** 20**__ = 20\n\n⇒ __**20 + 1**__ − 400 = 20\n\n⇒__21 - 400__ = 20\n\n⇒ 379 ≠ 20\n\nOption 4) − and ÷\n⇒ 20 + 20 × __**20 ÷ 20**__ - 20 = 20\n\n⇒ 20 + __**20 × 1**__ - 20 = 20\n\n⇒ __**20 + **20__ - 20 = 20\n\n⇒__**40 - 20**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 20 = 20\n\nHence, the correct answer is **option (4).**",
